   147	## 5. Frontend Pattern
   148	
   149	### Scope
   150	- Label: `Stack-Specific`
   151	- Stack context: React, TypeScript, Vite, TanStack Query, React Hook Form, AJV (BLUEPRINT 2.1)
   152	
   153	### Decision
   154	- Form strategy: React Hook Form with AJV validation against the shared JSON Schemas.
   155	- Data-fetching strategy: TanStack Query over the OpenAPI contract; no client-side permission derivation.
   156	- Validation strategy: the same JSON Schema files the backend validates against (ADR-0013).
   157	
   158	### Rationale
   159	- ADR-0013, ADR-0036; the semantic-first UX in section 72.
   160	
   161	### Applied In
   162	- `experience/`: from F0021; feature-slice folders `src/features/<feature>/`
   163	
   164	### Enforcement Level
   165	- `SHOULD` until F0021 lands, then `MUST`
   166	
   167	### Example
   168	
   169	```text
   170	React Hook Form + AJV (draft 2020-12) + TanStack Query, semantic theme tokens only
   171	```
